# Apex → www
# (configure DNS in Cloudflare so ownchart.me proxies to Pages, then this rule
# normalizes the URL. Apex-to-www requires the apex CNAME to resolve through
# Cloudflare Pages first; the rewrite happens at the Pages edge.)
https://ownchart.me/*    https://www.ownchart.me/:splat    301
